<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17009" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">expenso</span></b> , āvi, 1, v.
			freq. a.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To pay out</i>, <i>pay</i> (ante- and
			post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">argentum accepto, expenso,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 2, 2, 31</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nummos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 40, 5, 41, § 10</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To equalize</i>, <i>distribute
			equally</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dies intercalares intercalationibus quatuor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 13</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
